{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=rock_fb
|display=200x200px
|description=Rock does a kick to the shins. Despite the kick being aimed towards the opponent's legs, it is not a Low. A strong poke and easy hit confirm. Rock can chain into this after 2A or 2B, making it an easy autopilot option when up close. It's special cancelable, so Rock can use f.B to end his light chains with a cancel into Light Hard Edge. 

